Bug Fixes Fixed a known softlock Performance improvements Fixed a bug that prevented the timer from displaying in the Spanish version Tried the demo? Tell us what you thought with a review. It goes a long way toward getting Frog Knight noticed, and it's the push the ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T23:04:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114038246","verified_at":"2026-10-23T23:11:37Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3897830-1847286114030789","game_id":"steam-3897830","kind":"update","title":"Hotfix: Spanish timer","summary":"Fixed a visual bug affecting the timer when playing in Spanish.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-22T01:24:23Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114030789","verified_at":"2026-10-22T03:50:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3897830-1846651706695510","game_id":"steam-3897830","kind":"update","title":"Hotfix v0.6.3: More Demo Improvements During the Steam Next Fest","summary":"Hotfix v0.6.3: The Little Frog Keeps Getting Polished The Steam Next Fest is still going, and we keep tuning the demo so every climb feels better. This hotfix follows up on the last one with more quick fixes, because a frog stuck after a saw isn't reaching any summit. Bug Fixes Fixed softlock when sliding after a saw Fixed gravity not resetting after wall slides Fixed ghost Hardfall Fixed disabled Wall Jump Improvements Added milliseconds to the level-end screen Play Frog Knight during the Steam","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-20T14:27:25Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706695510","verified_at":"2026-10-21T02:52:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3897830-1846651706691080","game_id":"steam-3897830","kind":"update","title":"Hotfix v0.6.2: Quick Tweaks for the Steam Next Fest","summary":"Hotfix v0.6.2: Ready for the Steam Next Fest The Steam Next Fest starts today, and the little frog wants to greet you at its best. That's why this hotfix brings quick tweaks to improve your experience. Fair warning: the walls now hit back when you fall, and the sword has even more to say about it. Gameplay & Improvements Wall Bounces: added wall bounces when falling, making falls more chaotic The timer now displays milliseconds for more precise speedrunning Mocking Sword The Mocking Sword now ha","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T16:27:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691080","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:13:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3897830-1846651706685662","game_id":"steam-3897830","kind":"announcement","title":"Frog Knight Speedrun Tournament: Prizes on the Line!","summary":"TOURNAMENT ANNOUNCEMENT Hey everyone! We have an important announcement today, so please read carefully because this may be interesting to you: There will be a speedrunning event between the 19th and 26th of October (Your run has to be submitted during this period to count). The category is Demo% (Any% on the 6.0.1 version + upcoming versions in case of an update). There will be a prize for the first 3 positions: 500 USD 100 USD 50 USD Also, we will be giving away 30 keys to the top 30 times for","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-17T21:26:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706685662","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:13:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3897830-1846018067934610","game_id":"steam-3897830","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update: Big Visual Upgrade and Gameplay Improvements","summary":"Frog Knight has a new look 🐸Some journeys deserve better scenery. The goal is still to climb, but now you'll do it through revamped environments, with different light, a different atmosphere, and a lot more character. New Look Major visual overhaul across the demo New environments, backgrounds, lighting, and atmosphere Updated visuals throughout the game Gameplay & Improvements New and reworked areas Improved movement and environmental interactions General gameplay and presentation polish New Fe","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T20:38:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067934610","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:13:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3897830-1846018067934538","game_id":"steam-3897830","kind":"announcement","title":"Gameplay","summary":"Watch the gameplay","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T19:59:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067934538","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:13:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3897830-1844115010490487","game_id":"steam-3897830","kind":"announcement","title":"Frog Knight Gameplay","summary":"Watch this Frog Knight gameplay","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-17T00:11:09Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010490487","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:13:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3897830-1843481262687745","game_id":"steam-3897830","kind":"announcement","title":"Frog Knight is nominated at the DevGAMM Awards 2026!","summary":"Frog Knight has been nominated at the DevGAMM Awards 2026. Every jump, every fall, every attempt to climb just a little higher than the last... Frog Knight was born from the desire to make a hard game that still felt special. And now that part of the work is competing with the best of the indie industry. Winners will be chosen by a panel of experts, publishers, and gaming veterans. Results will be announced at the DevGAMM Lisbon awards ceremony in November 2026. Thank you for coming this far wit","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-09T01:38:05Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262687745","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:13:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3897830-1842212951314729","game_id":"steam-3897830","kind":"announcement","title":"Gameplay","summary":"Watch the gameplay 🐸","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-01T21:14:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951314729","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:13:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3897830-1842212951311891","game_id":"steam-3897830","kind":"announcement","title":"Frog Knight is coming to the BIG Fall Showcase 2026","summary":"Frog Knight is jumping into the BIG Fall Showcase 2026! 🐸 On September 1st at 8 AM Pacific, our little frog joins one of the biggest indie showcases of the season. It's time to gather, see what's new in the indie world, and support the developers pouring their hearts into their games. Watch the showcase live here: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HW3LXNTR2bM See you there! 🐸","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-01T01:18:29Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951311891","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:13:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3897830-1840310314338040","game_id":"steam-3897830","kind":"announcement","title":"Gameplay","summary":"Watch the gameplay 🐸","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-05T02:25:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314338040","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:13:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3897830-1836506165578786","game_id":"steam-3897830","kind":"update","title":"New update out now! The journey begins here.","summary":"A new update has arrived! 🐸Every great journey has a beginning. Now you can see how your favorite frog's story starts. This update brings an intro cinematic to the game, along with movement improvements, bug fixes, and a hidden surprise you may have already stumbled upon. We're polishing every jump, every fall, and every corner of the well so Frog Knight doesn't just challenge you, it wins you over. What's New Intro cinematic added. The final art will be even better! New jump system for smoother","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-07T19:06:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165578786","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:13:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3897830-1833334318578249","game_id":"steam-3897830","kind":"announcement","title":"Game Effect Showcase 2026","summary":"From May 25 to June 1, FrogKnight will be featured in the Game Effect Showcase on Steam.We’re really excited to share that we’re part of this edition of the showcase, alongside a ton of amazing indie projects from the Spanish-speaking development scene.Thanks for your support, and don’t forget to add it to your wishlist!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-25T23:44:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1833334318578249","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:13:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3897830-1818752592120792","game_id":"steam-3897830","kind":"announcement","title":"Frog Knight – The Official Steam Demo Is Now Live!","summary":"We’re excited to announce that the official Frog Knight demo is now available on Steam!It’s the first time players can jump into the cursed vertical pit and experience the core movement and bounce mechanics that define the game.What’s Included in This DemoThis early slice of the game is designed to showcase the heart of Frog Knight:A curated section of the giant vertical worldAll core movement and bounce mechanicsEarly-game challenges focused on timing, control, and precisionThe starting abiliti","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-12-10T13:36:17Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1818752592120792","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:13:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3897830":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:02:08Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:02:08Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3897830":"2026-10-26T11:02:08Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3897830":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:02:08Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:02:08Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:02:08Z"},"4171290":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T11:02:08Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T11:02:08Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T11:02:08Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"ga